    "start": 8.360999999999997,
    "end": 9.642000000000003,
    "text": "I'd rather speak in rhyme."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0043",
    "start": 10.543999999999997,
    "end": 11.244999999999997,
    "text": "You like that, huh?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0108",
    "start": 11.523000000000003,
    "end": 11.723999999999997,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0108",
    "start": 13.625,
    "end": 17.247999999999998,
    "text": "So, why I gotta be all that, is that rhyme?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0043",
    "start": 19.490000000000002,
    "end": 23.732999999999997,
    "text": "That's pretty cheesy. You goof."
