    "start": 24.154000000000003,
    "end": 25.335,
    "text": "Mary had a little lamb."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0043",
    "start": 27.962000000000003,
    "end": 29.122,
    "text": "I'm going to stay away from those."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0108",
    "start": 30.859,
    "end": 33.821,
    "text": "Talk a little louder when you talk to me, I'm a musician, I can't hear anything."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0043",
    "start": 33.484,
    "end": 34.884,
    "text": "Oh, that's right. I forgot you're deaf."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0108",
    "start": 41.108999999999995,
    "end": 49.92100000000001,
    "text": "What would you do? Would you talk in rhyme or would you sing? Yeah."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0043",
    "start": 46.92700000000001,
    "end": 47.828,
    "text": "I'd probably like to sing it."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0043",
    "start": 50.208,
    "end": 50.428,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0043",
    "start": 51.849000000000004,
    "end": 52.649,
    "text": "Like a rock star."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0108",
    "start": 52.705,
    "end": 58.893,
    "text": "Demonstrate, please. You said sing, man. You should have said rhyme."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0043",
    "start": 54.169,
    "end": 56.269999999999996,
    "text": "No, I can't do that right now."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0108",
    "start": 65.943,
    "end": 71.107,
    "text": "Oh, let me see. How about born in the USA?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P0043",
    "start": 71.297,
